# PG Management Software — User Flows & Page Flows

---

## Part 1: Admin-Tenant Relationship & Permission Matrix

### User Roles

#### **Role 1: Admin (PG Owner / Receptionist)**

- Full control over PG data
- Can create, edit, delete tenant records
- Can assign/reassign rooms
- Can mark payments, generate receipts
- Can upload and verify documents
- Can view all reports and history

#### **Role 2: Tenant (Future v2)**

- View own profile (name, room, rent due)
- View own payment history
- Submit complaints (v2)
- Cannot edit admin data
- Cannot see other tenants' data

**Note**: v1 = Admin only. Tenant features deferred to v2.

