### Admin Workflows vs Tenant Workflows

#### **Admin Workflow (Daily)**

```
LOGIN
  ↓
DASHBOARD (check metrics: occupancy, pending, overdue)
  ↓
DECISION TREE:
  ├─ New tenant arriving? → Go to "Add Tenant" flow
  ├─ Tenant paid? → Go to "Mark Payment" flow
  ├─ Room vacant? → Go to "Reassign Room" flow
  ├─ Need receipt? → Go to "Generate Receipt" flow
  └─ Check history? → Go to "Payment Log" flow
```

#### **Tenant Workflow (v2)**

```
LOGIN
  ↓
DASHBOARD (view own rent due, payment history)
  ↓
DECISION:
  ├─ View rent status? → View own payment status
  ├─ Submit complaint? → Complaint form (v2)
  └─ Update contact? → Edit own profile (v2)
```

