## Part 2: Detailed Page Flows

### **PAGE 1: LOGIN / SIGNUP**

```
ENTRY POINT: /auth

┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│     PG Management Software          │
│                                     │
│  Email: [____________]              │
│  Password: [____________]           │
│                                     │
│  [LOGIN BUTTON]                     │
│                                     │
│  Don't have account? [SIGN UP]      │
└─────────────────────────────────────┘

LOGIC:
  - New user clicks "SIGN UP"
    → Route to /auth/signup
    → Enter email + password + PG name
    → Validate email (no duplicates)
    → Create account → Auto-login → Redirect to /dashboard
    
  - Existing user clicks "LOGIN"
    → Enter email + password
    → Validate credentials
    → Success → Redirect to /dashboard
    → Failure → Show error message + retry

STATE AFTER LOGIN:
  - User object: { id, email, pg_name, role: 'admin' }
  - Auth token stored in localStorage
  - All subsequent requests include token
```

