### **Workflow 2: Payment Lifecycle**

```
RENT CREATED (auto on tenant creation + 30 days)
  │
  │ Monthly cycle repeats
  │
  ▼
┌──────────────────────┐
│ DUE (30 days prior)  │
│ Status: PENDING      │
│ Amount: ₹X           │
│ Due Date: Sept 5     │
└──────────┬───────────┘
           │
           ├─ Due date passes?
           │  └──▶ Status: OVERDUE (dashboard flags)
           │
           ├─ Admin marks "PAID"?
           │  │
           │  ▼
           │  ┌──────────────────┐
           │  │ Status: PAID      │
           │  │ Receipt generated │
           │  │ Date recorded     │
           │  └──────────────────┘
           │
           └─ Dispute?
              └──▶ Payment marked DISPUTED (v2)
                  └──▶ Admin review required

KEY RULES:
- Once marked PAID, cannot revert (audit trail)
- Overdue = today > due_date
- Auto-calculate next month's rent due date
```

