         │  └──▶ File validation (size < 5MB)
         │
         ▼
┌────────────────────────────┐
│ DOCUMENT_UPLOADED          │
│ Status: PENDING_VERIFICATION
│ URL: storage/proof_xyz.pdf │
└────────────┬───────────────┘
             │
             ├─ Admin verifies manually
             │  └──▶ Status: VERIFIED
             │       └──▶ Tenant profile complete
             │
             └─ Admin rejects (corrupted file)?
                └──▶ Status: REJECTED
                    └──▶ Re-upload required

KEY RULES:
- No document = tenant cannot be finalized
- Encrypted storage
- Immutable after verification (for audit)
