     └─ Can generate reports

┌─────────┐
│ TENANT  │
│ (v2)    │
└────┬────┘
     │
     ├─ Read-only own profile
     ├─ Read own payment history
     ├─ Cannot modify any data (v1)
     └─ Cannot see other tenants
