```
Tenant Flow:
  1. Tenant receives invite link from Admin
  2. Signs up with email
  3. Views own rent due & payment history
  4. Submits complaints
  5. Admin approves/resolves (v2)

Admin Flow (unchanged):
  1. Manages all tenant + room + payment data
  2. Sends invites to tenants
  3. Reviews tenant submissions
  4. Generates reports
